            "createdAt": "2026-09-20T13:04:47.752Z",
            "langs": [
              "en"
            ],
            "text": "Historically, automation tech has commonly made more work for people: the issue is WHICH people. Whether as an excuse for owners to increase the requirements for expectations in a given day, lessen the labor expected of men while raising the expectations for women, etc. \"AI\" isn't exceptional."
